{"name":"Gris Morado","hex":"#8f8a91","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[],"entries":[{"title":"Gris","blocks":[{"text":"Gris is a 2018 platform-adventure game by Spanish developer Nomada Studio and published by Devolver Digital. The game was released for macOS, Nintendo Switch, and Windows in December 2018, for iOS in August 2019, for PlayStation 4 in November 2019, for Android in April 2020, for Amazon Luna in November 2021, and for PlayStation 5, Xbox One and Xbox Series X/S in December 2022. The game has sold over 3 million copies."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/8/84/GrisCoverImage.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gris","wikidata":"Q59769284"},{"title":"Machaerium scleroxylon","blocks":[{"text":"Machaerium scleroxylon is a species of tree in the family Fabaceae Common names for the species include: pau ferro, morado, caviuna, Bolivian rosewood, and Santos rosewood. The wood is used as an alternative species to genuine rosewoods belonging to the genus Dalbergia."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/bc/Machaerium_scleroxylon_infloresc%C3%AAncia_1.jpg/330px-Machaerium_scleroxylon_infloresc%C3%AAncia_1.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Machaerium_scleroxylon","wikidata":"Q4043538"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/8/81/Gris_Screenshot.jpg/330px-Gris_Screenshot.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/8/81/Gris_Screenshot.jpg/330px-Gris_Screenshot.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Gris in the palm of the statue where she wakes up","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AGris_Screenshot.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/27/Adri%C3%A